  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組新增了來自<strong><em>Apex Legends。</em></strong>的更多槍械。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>R-301 突擊步槍</strong></span></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://imgpp.com/image/301.Cc0f8\" alt=\"\"></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTbmDFZk/301.png\" width=\"716\" height=\"300\"></em></strong></span></p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>30-30 連發步槍</strong></span></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PrqDL03x/3030.png\" width=\"761\" height=\"214\"></em></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>M600 噴火</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZRsCS58h/spirefire.png\" width=\"815\" height=\"328\"></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Kraber 狙擊步槍</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J0XzJckp/kr.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"342\"><br><br></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mr. Crayfish's Gun Mod</a>&nbsp;才能運作。<br></span>1.20.1 版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod [Unofficial]</a> 才能運作。<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有槍械配方均可於設定檔中修改。(1.12.2 之後的版本需開啟 jar 檔案進行修改)<br><br></span></pre>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
